          "cells": [
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c00",
              "column": 0,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "曲成圉矦蟲達",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 1,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": [
                {
                  "start": 4,
                  "end": 6,
                  "surface": "蟲達",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "原表本列始封者；蠱逢等異文另存逐來源判讀。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c00-m000"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c01",
              "column": 1,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "以西城戶將三十七人從起碭，至霸上，爲執金吾，五年，爲二隊將，屬周呂矦，入漢，定三秦，以都尉破項籍陳下，矦，亖千戶。以將軍擊燕、代。",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 2,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": [
                {
                  "start": 31,
                  "end": 34,
                  "surface": "周呂矦",
                  "person_id": "acg_se3_w5x",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "呂后本紀長兄周呂侯與追尊酈侯父為悼武王相互銜接；不同稱號不改原文。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c01-m000"
                },
                {
                  "start": 46,
                  "end": 48,
                  "surface": "項籍",
                  "person_id": "ob7_g6i_7pp",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "本列破楚軍於陳下，依項羽本紀籍字羽辨識。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c01-m001"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c02",
              "column": 2,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "三月庚子封，二十二年薨。",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 3,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": []
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c03",
              "column": 3,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "十八位次曰夜矦恒。",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 4,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": [],
              "unresolved_mentions": [
                {
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c03-u000",
                  "start": 5,
                  "end": 8,
                  "surface": "夜矦恒",
                  "kind": "unresolved_reference",
                  "status": "awaiting_collation",
                  "person_id": null,
                  "interpretation_note": "原位次注語作夜矦恒；卷末考證另言位次曰夜恆侯、監本訛夜侯恒。保留原字及未定指涉，不以此拆出新人物或強接蟲達。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04",
              "column": 4,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "孝文元年，矦捷嗣，八年，有罪，免。十亖年，捷復封，十八年，復免。戶九千三百。孝景中五年，矦捷復封，五年薨。",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 5,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": [
                {
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 2,
                  "surface": "孝文",
                  "person_id": "yqp_nlb_p1p_AC",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "本表孝文元年與孝景中五年相接，對照孝景本紀首段孝文、孝景兩帝。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m000"
                },
                {
                  "start": 6,
                  "end": 7,
                  "surface": "捷",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi_A",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "原子欄三處同一嗣侯、免及復封；不把免封期間補成連續在爵。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m001"
                },
                {
                  "start": 21,
                  "end": 22,
                  "surface": "捷",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi_A",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "原子欄三處同一嗣侯、免及復封；不把免封期間補成連續在爵。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m002"
                },
                {
                  "start": 38,
                  "end": 40,
                  "surface": "孝景",
                  "person_id": "yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "本表文景武年序中之景帝，對照孝景本紀首段。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m003"
                },
                {
                  "start": 45,
                  "end": 46,
                  "surface": "捷",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi_A",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "原子欄三處同一嗣侯、免及復封；不把免封期間補成連續在爵。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m004"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c05",
              "column": 5,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "建元二年，矦皇柔嗣，二十亖年，元鼎二年，坐爲汝南太守知民不用赤側錢爲賦，爲鬼薪。",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 6,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": [
                {
                  "start": 6,
                  "end": 8,
                  "surface": "皇柔",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi_*A",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "原孫欄相對蟲達；皋柔為史表同事異文，不據子欄補父。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c05-m000"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c06",
              "column": 6,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "曾孫",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 7,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": []
            },
            {
              "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c07",
              "column": 7,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "colspan": 1,
              "text": "元康亖年，達玄孫茂陵公乘宣詔復家。",
              "source_row": 69,
              "source_column": 8,
              "printed_page": null,
              "person_mentions": [
                {
                  "start": 5,
                  "end": 6,
                  "surface": "達",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "本格達玄孫，回指始封者蟲達。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c07-m000"
                },
                {
                  "start": 12,
                  "end": 13,
                  "surface": "宣",
                  "person_id": "d7u_bgr_wdi_***A",
                  "status": "contextual_provisional",
                  "interpretation_note": "達玄孫明示四代；中間三代不補姓名。",
                  "id": "hanshu-016-t1-r068-c07-m001"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "continuation": null
    }
  ]
